<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta http-equiv="Cache-Control" content="no-store">
<title>ASUS Wireless Router - AmneziaWG</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/index_style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/form_style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/res/softcenter.css"><script src="/js/jquery.js"></script><script src="/js/httpApi.js"></script><script src="/require/require.min.js"></script><script src="/state.js"></script><script src="/general.js"></script><script src="/popup.js"></script><script src="/help.js"></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/res/amneziawg-0.4.0.css"></head>
<body onload="awgInitial()"><div id="TopBanner"></div><div id="Loading" class="popup_bg"></div><table class="content" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td width="17" valign="top"></td><td width="202" valign="top"><div id="mainMenu"></div><div id="subMenu"></div></td><td valign="top"><div style="margin-top:-140px"><div id="tabMenu"></div><div class="app-shell awg-panel">
<header class="app-header"><div><h1>AmneziaWG</h1><p>客户端连接远端 · 服务端安全回家</p></div><div class="header-actions"><span class="device-label">RT-BE88U <span class="version">0.4.0</span></span><a class="back-softcenter" href="/Module_Softcenter.asp"><img src="/res/amneziawg-icons/arrow-left.svg" alt="">返回软件中心</a></div></header>
<nav class="app-nav" aria-label="插件导航"><button id="nav_home" class="nav-item" onclick="awgPage('home')">客户端</button><button id="nav_server" class="nav-item active" aria-current="page" onclick="awgPage('server')">服务端</button><button id="nav_import" class="nav-item" onclick="awgPage('import')">添加节点</button><button id="nav_settings" class="nav-item" onclick="awgPage('settings')">客户端设置</button><button id="nav_logs" class="nav-item" onclick="awgPage('logs')">日志与诊断</button></nav>
<div id="awg_message" aria-live="polite"></div>
<main>
<section id="page_home" hidden aria-label="连接概览"><div class="home-grid">
<div class="connection-card"><div class="eyebrow">连接远端服务器</div><button id="awg_start" class="connect-button" onclick="awgConnect()" disabled><span id="awg_connect_title">读取状态</span><small id="awg_connect_hint">请稍候</small></button><span id="awg_state" class="awg-state" role="status">正在读取状态…</span><p id="awg_home_hint" class="muted">安全连接，从添加一个节点开始。</p><button id="awg_stop" class="text-button" onclick="awgAction('down')">停止并恢复直连</button><div class="connection-footer"><span id="awg_route_badge">仅建立隧道</span><button class="icon-button" onclick="awgRefresh()" aria-label="刷新状态"><img src="/res/amneziawg-icons/refresh.svg" alt=""></button></div></div>
<div class="server-column"><div class="section-heading"><h2>客户端节点</h2><button class="icon-button" onclick="awgPage('import')" aria-label="添加节点"><img src="/res/amneziawg-icons/plus.svg" alt=""></button></div>
<div class="server-card"><div class="card-icon"><img src="/res/amneziawg-icons/server.svg" alt=""></div><div class="server-title"><span class="eyebrow">当前节点</span><h2 id="awg_active_name">尚未添加节点</h2><div class="muted">AmneziaWG <span id="awg_endpoint"></span></div></div><span class="protocol-label">AWG</span></div>
<div id="awg_configured" class="muted">配置状态未知</div><div id="awg_profile_cards" class="profile-cards"></div>
<div class="node-actions"><label class="sr-only" for="awg_profile">已保存配置</label><select id="awg_profile" onchange="awgProfileSelect()" aria-label="已保存配置"></select><button id="awg_switch" class="secondary" onclick="awgSwitch()">切换节点</button><button id="awg_delete" class="icon-button danger" onclick="awgDelete()" aria-label="删除所选节点"><img src="/res/amneziawg-icons/trash.svg" alt=""></button></div>
<div class="stats-card"><div><span>接收流量</span><strong id="awg_total_rx">0 B</strong></div><div><span>发送流量</span><strong id="awg_total_tx">0 B</strong></div></div>
<div class="protection-card"><img src="/res/amneziawg-icons/shield-check.svg" alt=""><div><strong id="awg_protection_title">按需开启连接保护</strong><p id="awg_protection_note">在设置中配置 DNS 接管与断线保护。</p></div><button class="icon-button" onclick="awgPage('settings')" aria-label="打开保护设置"><img src="/res/amneziawg-icons/chevron-right.svg" alt=""></button></div>
</div></div>
<details class="connection-details"><summary>连接详情</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table class="peer-table"><thead><tr><th>服务器</th><th>最近握手</th><th>接收 / 发送</th></tr></thead><tbody id="awg_peers"></tbody></table></div><p id="awg_peer_empty" class="muted">暂无 Peer 状态</p><p id="awg_health" class="muted">自动切换尚无探测记录</p></details></section>

<section id="page_server">
<div class="server-toolbar"><div><h2>AmneziaWG 服务端</h2><p>手机或电脑从外网连接回家。保存设置 → 添加设备 → 导出配置 → 启动服务端。</p></div><span id="sv_status" class="awg-state">读取状态…</span></div>
<div id="sv_warning" class="awg-note warning" role="status"></div>
<div class="form-card"><h3 class="form-caption">一般设置</h3><table class="settings-table"><tbody>
<tr><th>外网连接地址</th><td><select id="sv_endpoint_mode" aria-label="外网地址获取方式"><option value="auto">自动读取路由器 DDNS / WAN IP</option><option value="manual">手动填写域名或 IP</option></select><input id="sv_endpoint" aria-label="手动外网地址" placeholder="vpn.example.com"><div class="awg-note">当前导出地址：<strong id="sv_detected">正在读取</strong><br>路由器 DDNS：<span id="sv_ddns">正在读取</span> · <a href="/Advanced_ASUSDDNS_Content.asp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DDNS 设置</a></div></td></tr>
<tr><th><label for="sv_port">监听端口（UDP）</label></th><td><input id="sv_port" type="number" min="1" max="65535" value="51830"><div class="awg-note">默认 51830，与现有 WireGuard 独立；启动前检查端口是否占用。</div></td></tr>
<tr><th><label for="sv_address">IPv4 隧道地址</label></th><td><input id="sv_address" value="10.77.0.1/24"><div class="awg-note">设备地址和密钥自动分配，无需手工填写。</div></td></tr>
<tr><th><label for="sv_allow_lan">访问家庭局域网</label></th><td><label class="switch-label"><input id="sv_allow_lan" type="checkbox" checked> 允许访问 NAS、电脑和路由器</label><div class="awg-note">主 LAN：<span id="sv_lan">正在读取</span>。关闭时需关闭 Flow Cache / Runner 硬件加速以保证隔离。</div></td></tr>
<tr><th><label for="sv_internet">通过家里上网</label></th><td><label class="switch-label"><input id="sv_internet" type="checkbox"> 将客户端互联网流量发回家</label><div class="awg-note">关闭时仅路由家庭网络；IPv6 互联网需在高级设置中启用 IPv6 隧道。</div></td></tr>
<tr><th><label for="sv_auto">开机自动启动</label></th><td><label><input id="sv_auto" type="checkbox"> 启用服务端</label></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<details class="advanced"><summary>高级设置<span>IPv6 · DNS · 混淆参数 · 公钥</span></summary><table class="settings-table"><tbody>
<tr><th><label for="sv_address6">IPv6 隧道地址</label></th><td><input id="sv_address6" placeholder="留空禁用，例如 fd77:77::1/64"><div class="awg-note">使用 ULA /64；IPv6 上网采用 NAT66，需要固件支持。添加设备前确定地址范围。</div></td></tr>
<tr><th>兼容 fullv 上网</th><td><label><input id="sv_fullv" type="checkbox">让浏览器回退到 TCP</label><div class="awg-note">通过家里上网时拒绝公网 UDP 443（QUIC），让浏览器改用 TCP。不改 fullv 节点与分流规则；需已启用 fullv。修改后重新启动服务端生效。</div></td></tr>
<tr><th><label for="sv_dns">客户端 DNS</label></th><td><input id="sv_dns" placeholder="如 1.1.1.1，多个用逗号分隔"><div class="awg-note">全局上网且允许访问局域网时，留空使用路由器 LAN 地址作为 DNS；禁止局域网时默认 1.1.1.1。仅回家时留空不改 DNS。自定义 DNS 必须位于允许访问的范围。</div></td></tr>
<tr><th><label for="sv_extra">AmneziaWG 参数</label></th><td><textarea id="sv_extra" rows="7" spellcheck="false" placeholder="首次保存时自动生成，通常无需修改"></textarea><div class="awg-note">修改参数后需重新导出所有设备配置。</div></td></tr>
<tr><th>服务端公钥</th><td><code id="sv_public">首次保存后自动生成</code></td></tr></tbody></table></details>
<div class="form-actions"><button class="primary" id="sv_save" onclick="awgServerSave()">保存设置</button><button class="primary" id="sv_start" onclick="awgServerAction('server-up')">启动服务端</button><button id="sv_stop" onclick="awgServerAction('server-down')">停止服务端</button><button onclick="awgServerAction('server-status')">刷新</button></div></div>
<div class="form-card client-devices"><h3 class="form-caption">VPN 设备 <span id="sv_count">0 / 10</span></h3><div class="device-add"><input id="sv_name" maxlength="40" placeholder="设备名称，例如：我的手机" aria-label="新设备名称"><button class="primary" id="sv_add" onclick="awgServerAction('server-add',{name:awgEl('sv_name').value.trim()})">添加设备</button></div><div class="table-scroll"><table class="peer-table"><thead><tr><th>设备</th><th>隧道地址</th><th>状态 / 最近握手</th><th>接收 / 发送</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody id="sv_clients"></tbody></table></div><p id="sv_empty" class="muted">还没有设备。保存设置后，填写名称即可生成密钥和配置。</p><p class="awg-note">运行中可添加、删除、禁用或启用设备，仅影响目标设备。禁用保留原配置，重新启用后无需重新导入；删除后原配置失效。修改服务端设置仍需先停止。导出的 .conf 含该设备私钥，请妥善保管。</p></div>
</section>
<section id="page_settings" hidden><div class="page-heading"><div class="eyebrow">PREFERENCES</div><h1>连接设置</h1><p>先建立隧道，再选择哪些设备通过它访问网络。</p></div><div class="form-card"><table class="settings-table"><tbody><tr><th><label for="awg_mode">流量模式</label></th><td><select id="awg_mode"><option value="tunnel">仅建立隧道（默认）</option><option value="lan">局域网按 AllowedIPs 分流</option></select></td></tr><tr><th><label for="awg_source">来源设备 / 网段</label></th><td><input id="awg_source" type="text" placeholder="留空表示主 LAN 网段" autocomplete="off"><div class="awg-note">单台设备填写 192.168.50.100/32；需位于主 LAN 网段内。</div></td></tr><tr><th><label for="awg_auto">开机自动连接</label></th><td><label><input id="awg_auto" type="checkbox"> 启用</label></td></tr></tbody></table><details class="advanced"><summary>高级设置<span>IPv6 · DNS · 断线保护 · 故障切换</span></summary><table class="settings-table"><tbody><tr><th><label for="awg_ipv6">IPv6 双栈分流</label></th><td><label><input id="awg_ipv6" type="checkbox"> 同时接管 IPv6（需要服务器支持 IPv6）</label></td></tr><tr><th><label for="awg_source6">IPv6 来源设备 / 网段</label></th><td><input id="awg_source6" type="text" placeholder="留空自动识别唯一的 LAN IPv6 网段" style="width:360px"><div class="awg-note">单台设备可用 /128；存在多个 IPv6 前缀时请明确填写。</div></td></tr><tr><th><label for="awg_dns_on">自动接管 DNS</label></th><td><label><input id="awg_dns_on" type="checkbox"> 接管所选 LAN 设备的 TCP / UDP 53 请求</label><div class="awg-note">使用配置中每种地址族的第一个 DNS，并强制经隧道路由。阻止 853 端口；不识别应用自带的 DoH。</div></td></tr><tr><th>配置中的 DNS</th><td><span id="awg_dns">未配置</span></td></tr><tr><th><label for="awg_kill">断线保护</label></th><td><label><input id="awg_kill" type="checkbox"> 隧道异常时阻止所选设备直连外网</label><div class="awg-note">保留 LAN 管理访问。需要关闭路由器 Flow Cache / Runner 硬件加速，并同时开启 DNS 接管；LAN 有 IPv6 时也必须开启双栈。点击“停止并恢复直连”才解除保护。</div></td></tr><tr><th><label for="awg_failover">自动故障切换</label></th><td><label><input id="awg_failover" type="checkbox"> 连续 3 轮探测失败后尝试备用节点</label><div class="awg-note">每分钟检测，至少间隔 3 分钟切换。需要断线保护和备用配置；依赖路由器 cron。</div></td></tr><tr><th><label for="awg_fallbacks">备用节点</label></th><td><select id="awg_fallbacks" multiple size="4" style="min-width:260px"></select><div class="awg-note">按列表顺序尝试；按住 Ctrl 可多选。</div></td></tr><tr><th><label for="awg_targets">连通性探测 IP</label></th><td><input id="awg_targets" type="text" style="width:330px" placeholder="1.1.1.1, 9.9.9.9"><div class="awg-note">最多 3 个，以逗号分隔。须在每个节点 AllowedIPs 内，并能响应 ICMP；任一成功即视为健康。</div></td></tr></tbody></table></details><div class="awg-controls"><button class="primary" id="awg_save" onclick="awgSave()">保存设置</button><span class="awg-note">停止并恢复直连后可修改运行设置。</span></div>
<p class="awg-note">LAN 模式保留主路由表中的内网和已有特定路由。保护范围仅限所选来源网段，路由器自身发起的流量不在接管范围。若未启用双栈，IPv6 保持原有路由。与 fancyss 等插件共用策略路由可能冲突，请先用单台设备测试。</p>
</div></section>
<section id="page_import" hidden><div class="page-heading"><div class="eyebrow">NEW CONNECTION</div><h1>添加一个节点</h1><p>像配置 WireGuard 一样填写信息，或直接导入服务端提供的文件。</p></div>
<div class="form-card"><div class="method-tabs" role="group" aria-label="添加方式"><button class="selected" id="method_form" onclick="awgImportMode('form')">手动填写</button><button id="method_file" onclick="awgImportMode('file')">导入配置文件</button></div>
<label class="field">节点名称<input id="awg_name" type="text" maxlength="60" placeholder="例如：我的服务器" autocomplete="off"></label>
<div id="awg_form_fields"><div class="form-grid"><label class="field">服务器地址<input id="awg_host" type="text" placeholder="vpn.example.com 或服务器 IP" autocomplete="off"></label><label class="field">服务器端口<input id="awg_port" type="number" min="1" max="65535" value="51820"></label></div>
<label class="field">客户端隧道地址<input id="awg_address" type="text" placeholder="例如：10.8.0.2/32" autocomplete="off"><small>填写服务端分配给此客户端的地址。双栈地址可用逗号分隔。</small></label>
<label class="field">客户端私钥<input id="awg_private" type="password" placeholder="粘贴此客户端的 PrivateKey" autocomplete="new-password" spellcheck="false"></label>
<label class="field">服务端公钥<input id="awg_public" type="text" placeholder="粘贴服务端的 PublicKey" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"></label>
<label class="field">DNS <span class="optional">可选</span><input id="awg_form_dns" type="text" placeholder="例如：1.1.1.1，可用逗号分隔" autocomplete="off"><small>按服务端配置填写；是否接管局域网 DNS 可在连接设置中开启。</small></label>
<details class="advanced"><summary>高级参数<span>路由范围 · 预共享密钥 · 混淆参数</span></summary><div class="advanced-body">
<label class="field">AllowedIPs<input id="awg_allowed" type="text" value="0.0.0.0/0"><small>双栈全局路由可填写 0.0.0.0/0, ::/0；局域网接管在连接设置中单独启用。</small></label>
<div class="form-grid"><label class="field">MTU<input id="awg_mtu" type="number" placeholder="默认 1420"></label><label class="field">保活间隔（秒）<input id="awg_keepalive" type="number" min="0" max="65535" value="25"></label></div>
<label class="field">预共享密钥 <span class="optional">可选</span><input id="awg_psk" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="PresharedKey"></label>
<h2>AmneziaWG 混淆参数</h2><p class="awg-note">必须与服务端提供的参数一致。留空使用核心默认值；不确定时，建议直接导入服务端生成的 .conf。</p><div class="form-grid parameter-grid"><label class="field">Jc<input id="awg_extra_Jc" data-awg-extra="Jc" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="与服务端一致"></label><label class="field">Jmin<input id="awg_extra_Jmin" data-awg-extra="Jmin" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="与服务端一致"></label><label class="field">Jmax<input id="awg_extra_Jmax" data-awg-extra="Jmax" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="与服务端一致"></label><label class="field">S1<input id="awg_extra_S1" data-awg-extra="S1" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="与服务端一致"></label><label class="field">S2<input id="awg_extra_S2" data-awg-extra="S2" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="与服务端一致"></label><label class="field">S3<input id="awg_extra_S3" data-awg-extra="S3" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="与服务端一致"></label><label class="field">S4<input id="awg_extra_S4" data-awg-extra="S4" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="与服务端一致"></label><label class="field">H1<input id="awg_extra_H1" data-awg-extra="H1" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="与服务端一致"></label><label class="field">H2<input id="awg_extra_H2" data-awg-extra="H2" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="与服务端一致"></label><label class="field">H3<input id="awg_extra_H3" data-awg-extra="H3" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="与服务端一致"></label><label class="field">H4<input id="awg_extra_H4" data-awg-extra="H4" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="与服务端一致"></label><label class="field">I1<input id="awg_extra_I1" data-awg-extra="I1" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="与服务端一致"></label><label class="field">I2<input id="awg_extra_I2" data-awg-extra="I2" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="与服务端一致"></label><label class="field">I3<input id="awg_extra_I3" data-awg-extra="I3" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="与服务端一致"></label><label class="field">I4<input id="awg_extra_I4" data-awg-extra="I4" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="与服务端一致"></label><label class="field">I5<input id="awg_extra_I5" data-awg-extra="I5" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="与服务端一致"></label><label class="field">HeaderProtectionKey<input id="awg_extra_HeaderProtectionKey" data-awg-extra="HeaderProtectionKey" type="password" autocomplete="off" placeholder="与服务端一致"></label><label class="field">ContentPaddingAddition<input id="awg_extra_ContentPaddingAddition" data-awg-extra="ContentPaddingAddition" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="与服务端一致"></label><label class="field">RekeyAfterTime<input id="awg_extra_RekeyAfterTime" data-awg-extra="RekeyAfterTime" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="与服务端一致"></label><label class="field">RekeyTimeout<input id="awg_extra_RekeyTimeout" data-awg-extra="RekeyTimeout" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="与服务端一致"></label><label class="field">RejectAfterTime<input id="awg_extra_RejectAfterTime" data-awg-extra="RejectAfterTime" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="与服务端一致"></label><label class="field">KeepaliveTimeout<input id="awg_extra_KeepaliveTimeout" data-awg-extra="KeepaliveTimeout" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="与服务端一致"></label><label class="field">MaxHandshakeAttempts<input id="awg_extra_MaxHandshakeAttempts" data-awg-extra="MaxHandshakeAttempts" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="与服务端一致"></label><label class="field">RandomTrailers<input id="awg_extra_RandomTrailers" data-awg-extra="RandomTrailers" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="与服务端一致"></label><label class="field">DisableCookies<input id="awg_extra_DisableCookies" data-awg-extra="DisableCookies" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="与服务端一致"></label></div></div></details></div>
<div id="awg_file_fields" hidden><label class="upload-field" for="awg_file"><img src="/res/amneziawg-icons/upload.svg" alt=""><strong>选择 .conf 配置文件</strong><span>支持 AmneziaWG 1.x / 2.x / 3.x，最大 32 KB</span><input id="awg_file" type="file" accept=".conf,.txt" onchange="awgReadFile(this)"></label><label class="field">或粘贴完整配置<textarea id="awg_config" rows="10" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="[Interface]&#10;PrivateKey = …&#10;Address = …&#10;&#10;[Peer]&#10;PublicKey = …&#10;Endpoint = …&#10;AllowedIPs = …"></textarea></label></div>
<div class="form-actions"><button id="awg_import" class="primary" onclick="awgImport()">保存节点</button><button class="text-button" onclick="awgClearImport()">清空输入</button><span class="muted">私钥只保存在路由器本地</span></div><p class="awg-note">保存后返回首页连接。不执行配置中的脚本钩子；不支持 vpn:// 分享串。</p></div></section>
<section id="page_logs" hidden><div class="page-heading"><h1>日志与诊断</h1><p>查看操作结果，排查回家连接与 DNS 问题。</p></div>
<div class="form-card"><h3 class="form-caption">操作日志</h3><p class="awg-note">仅记录本次路由器开机后的插件操作，最多 200 条 / 64 KB，保存在内存目录；重启后清空。不记录私钥、预共享密钥或配置内容。</p><textarea id="awg_logs" readonly rows="10" aria-label="操作日志" spellcheck="false">点击刷新日志读取记录。</textarea><div class="form-actions"><button onclick="awgRequest('logs',{},true)">刷新日志</button><button data-local onclick="awgLogsCopy()">复制日志与诊断</button><button data-local onclick="awgLogsDownload()">下载报告</button></div></div>
<div class="form-card"><h3 class="form-caption">连接诊断</h3><p class="awg-note">检查服务端核心、设备变更、策略路由、防火墙、NAT 和 DNS。只读取状态，不重启服务。结果仅代表路由器本机检查，外网设备仍需实际测试。</p><div class="form-actions"><button class="primary" id="awg_diagnose" onclick="awgRequest('diagnose',{},true)">开始诊断</button><span id="awg_diag_time" class="awg-note" role="status">尚未检查</span></div><div class="table-scroll"><table class="peer-table"><thead><tr><th>检查项</th><th>结果</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody id="awg_diagnostics"></tbody></table></div></div></section></main><footer class="app-footer"><span>AmneziaWG for ASUS</span><span>社区适配插件 · ARM64 · 0.4.0</span></footer></div></div></td></tr></table><div id="footer"></div>
<div id="sv_config_modal" class="awg-panel config-overlay" hidden role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="sv_config_title" onkeydown="awgConfigKey(event)">
<div class="config-dialog"><div class="config-heading"><h2 id="sv_config_title">设备配置</h2><button id="sv_config_close" data-config-local onclick="awgConfigClose()" aria-label="关闭配置">关闭</button></div>
<p class="config-warning">配置含设备私钥，请勿分享给他人。二维码仅在本地生成。</p>
<div class="config-columns"><div class="config-scan"><canvas id="sv_config_qr" role="img" aria-label="设备配置二维码"></canvas><p id="sv_config_qr_note">使用支持 AmneziaWG 的客户端扫码导入</p></div>
<div class="config-text"><label for="sv_config_text">完整配置</label><textarea id="sv_config_text" readonly spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off" aria-label="完整设备配置"></textarea></div></div>
<div class="config-actions"><button id="sv_config_copy" data-config-local class="primary" onclick="awgConfigCopy()">复制配置</button><button data-config-local onclick="awgConfigDownload()">下载 .conf</button><span id="sv_config_feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span></div></div></div>
